              "value": "Sidestep"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: The attack roll for a Strike targeting the assassin fails or critically fails\n\nThe assassin deftly steps out of the way of the attack. If there's another creature adjacent to the assassin and within reach of the triggering attack, the assassin redirects the attack to that adjacent creature. The attacker then rerolls the Strike's attack roll against the new target."
            },
